/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (AS THE WORLD RECOGNIZES THE URGENT NEED TO TRANSITION TOWARDS SUSTAINABLE TRANSPORTATION, FORMULA MANIPAL IS ALIGNING ITSELF WITH EMBRACING ELECTRIC VEHICLES \(EVS\). RECOGNIZING THAT THE WIDESPREAD ADOPTION OF EVS REQUIRES SIGNIFICANT TECHNOLOGICAL ADVANCEMENTS, WE ARE COMMITTED TO DRIVING INNOVATION IN THIS FIELD. THROUGH RESEARCH, DEVELOPMENT, AND COLLABORATION, WE AIM TO OVERCOME EXISTING CHALLENGES AND PUSH THE BOUNDARIES OF WHAT EV TECHNOLOGY CAN ACHIEVE)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
